<!-- VENOMVINE_BUILD_SCRUB_GROWS_TEETH Q3 (owner card 2026-10-16): venomvine grows on its own clock, outside Explosive Growth.
     A roster def of our own: the engine (ExplosiveGrowth/Source/RM_ExplosiveGrowthRegistry.cs) unions exemptPlants (no soak)
     and bandExemptPlants (no everyday band) across EVERY RM_ExplosiveGrowthRosterDef loaded, so no edit to that mod is needed.
     Guarded by MayRequire: deploy rewrites the folded id to the composed Baroque Biomes id. If Explosive Growth renames
     these two fields, this def throws config errors at load: re-point it then. -->
